        "voiceRate": 2,
        "text": "Room Zero. The Unreturned Letter. A seated, hands only puzzle chapter for Meta Quest three."
      },
      {
        "slot": 1,
        "startSeconds": 7,
        "slotSeconds": 7.6,
        "spokenSeconds": 6.6,
        "voiceRate": 1,
        "text": "You are holding an ordinary letter, addressed to a room that no longer exists. Someone has to carry it there."
      },
      {
        "slot": 2,
        "startSeconds": 14.6,
        "slotSeconds": 4.8,
        "spokenSeconds": 4.1,
        "voiceRate": 2,
        "text": "You stay seated. Point at a lit lamp and pinch, to move there."
      },
      {
        "slot": 3,
        "startSeconds": 19.4,
        "slotSeconds": 7,
        "spokenSeconds": 6.1,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "The house has seams. Pinch the brass grip and slide it, and the rooms reconnect."
      },
      {
        "slot": 4,
        "startSeconds": 26.4,
        "slotSeconds": 12.6,
        "spokenSeconds": 10.2,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "Heavier seams need two hands. One hand braces, while the other pulls. Short prompts teach this in the room, right when you need it."
      },
      {
        "slot": 5,
        "startSeconds": 39,
        "slotSeconds": 11.6,
        "spokenSeconds": 7.9,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "Turn the room itself to open the Wrong Door. The house is a graph of doorways, and every seam you move rewires it."
      },
      {
        "slot": 6,
        "startSeconds": 50.6,
        "slotSeconds": 3.9,
        "spokenSeconds": 3.1,
        "voiceRate": 1,
        "text": "Each room has its own colour, and its own light."
      },
      {
        "slot": 7,
        "startSeconds": 54.5,
        "slotSeconds": 15.6,
        "spokenSeconds": 9.3,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "Then you are not alone. The Surveyor walks the same doorways you open. It plans its route through the same house graph that you are rewiring."
      },
      {
        "slot": 8,
        "startSeconds": 70.1,
        "slotSeconds": 17.3,
        "spokenSeconds": 10.7,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "To finish, work the lift with both hands. One hand anchors, the other pulls. Lift away, bring the room in, and lift back."
      },
      {
        "slot": 9,
        "startSeconds": 87.4,
        "slotSeconds": 18.4,
        "spokenSeconds": 7.5,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "Make room for Room Zero. Meanwhile the Surveyor is already on its way, so the last moves are a race."
      },
      {
        "slot": 10,
        "startSeconds": 105.8,
        "slotSeconds": 27.3,
        "spokenSeconds": 5.9,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "Pick up the letter, and place it in its slot. Delivering it ends the chapter."
      },
      {
        "slot": 11,
        "startSeconds": 133.2,
        "slotSeconds": 4.2,
        "spokenSeconds": 2.2,
        "voiceRate": 0,
        "text": "You are the return address."
      },
      {
        "slot": 12,
        "startSeconds": 137.3,
        "slotSeconds": 8,
        "spokenSeconds": 6.8,
        "voiceRate": 3,
        "text": "This is real gameplay from the emulator, with scripted hands. It was not recorded on a headset. The narration is a synthetic voice."
